
Fact x Identified by 0..10.
+x(0).

Event increment Terminates x When x
                Creates x(x+1) When x

Bool in-violation Holds when (x % 2 == 1) When x
Invariant not-in-violation When Not(in-violation())
Duty keep-not-in-violation Holder actor1 Claimant actor 2
  Violated when in-violation().
+keep-not-in-violation(Alice, Bob).

{
increment.
increment.
}

?Violated(keep-not-in-violation(Alice,Bob)).

